If you have any sort of feedback about this work that you would like to share with its author, feel fee to drop me a line at [feedback@abouthumans.net](mailto:feedback@abouthumans.net). I'd love to hear from you!

This work, like its subject, is a work in progress, and I'm always interested in hearing about ways in which it may be incomplete or inaccurate.
